The nullLinux 0.1.0-2 stabilization prebake used the icons installed by Fedora
package adwaita-icon-theme-50.0-1.fc44.noarch, whose source package is
adwaita-icon-theme-50.0-1.fc44.src.rpm. Its declared license is
LGPL-3.0-only OR CC-BY-SA-3.0. The accompanying COPYING, COPYING_CCBYSA3 and
COPYING_LGPL files are unmodified copies from that installed package.

nullLinux modifications (2026): bake/make_icons.py recolors SVG and PNG icons
using exact palette substitutions and luminance quantization, retaining SVG
shapes and PNG alpha. It renames the theme to nullLinux and sets its inherited
themes to Adwaita and hicolor. Cursor files are excluded.

